WEBVTT

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:30.160
(Applause)

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:34.280
I was 21 years old
when Trayvon Martin was murdered.

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:39.056
Trayvon Martin, a 17-year-old Black boy,

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:40.616
a Black child,

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:42.176
reminded me

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:43.736
reminded us

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:46.640
how little this nation
actually values Black life.

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.976
The hashtag #BlackLivesMatter

00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:52.456
became the most recognized call

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:54.976
for Black people and our children

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.856
to live in safe environments
and healthy communities

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.216
without fear

00:04:59.240 --> 00:05:02.600
from violence from individuals
or the state or government.